pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# NP-8.5 gate: with cheats on (--pinyon_shift_cheats=true), turning
# cheat_free_camera on in free roam switches the camera to the title's free
# camera (above the car), the left stick then flies it away from the parked
# car, and turning it off returns the chase camera; cheat.free_camera logs
# both switches.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 780 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 930 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1240 before
cvar 1250 cheat_free_camera true
capture 1290 enabled
input 1300 0000 0 0 0 32767 0 0
input 1460 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1500 moved
cvar 1510 cheat_free_camera false
capture 1560 reset
stop 1600
